1
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,600
Shopkeeper.

3
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:46,520
I wonder how Proprietor Yan is doing.

4
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,040
Shopkeeper,

5
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,560
you may compete fiercely in business
with Proprietor Yan,

6
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,920
but you really do care about her.

7
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,040
Business is business.

8
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:56,800
But you saw how terrifying
people on the Infinity Pill can become.

9
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,840
Master Zhao and Old Madam Zhao

10
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,360
are both gone now.

11
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,520
For a woman like Proprietor Yan,

12
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,960
making her way in the world alone
is not easy.

13
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:07,760
Fortunately, Lord Meng was there this time

14
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,960
and managed to save her.

15
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,240
My lord.

16
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,800
Heaven has shown mercy.

17
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:28,720
The poison in Miss Yan's body

18
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,800
is gradually dissipating.

19
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:32,560
With proper recuperation,
she will be fine.

20
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,000
Thank goodness you're all right.

21
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,080
Thank goodness you're back.

22
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,120
Mengmeng.

23
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,600
Fuzhi.

24
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,640
Did I hurt you?

25
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,280
This is all my fault.

26
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,480
I dragged you into all this trouble.

27
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,640
I'm sorry.

28
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,160
I'm sorry, Fuzhi.

29
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,360
Don't cry.

30
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,960
Thank you for coming so late,
Your Majesty.

31
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,520
Fuzhi is out of danger.

32
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,800
Since she's fine,

33
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,040
why are you still crying?

34
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,600
I'm afraid.

35
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:14,480
Afraid this is all another dream.

36
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,720
Afraid something worse
will happen again.

37
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,640
I'm afraid that even if I give everything,

38
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:23,240
I still can't protect those I love.

39
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,720
These past days,

40
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,600
watching you and Miss Yan
face life and death together,

41
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,760
I finally understood.

42
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,600
Without the lights of countless homes

43
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,920
in these ordinary streets,

44
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,680
a realm stretching thousands of miles

45
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,880
is nothing but cold lines on a map.

46
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,560
But I'm afraid

47
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:57,040
I can't even protect
this one small light before me.

48
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,800
The light you would die to protect

49
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:03,000
is the realm I must protect.

50
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:04,920
You protect it.

51
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,000
I will protect you,

52
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,040
and all the people of this realm.

53
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:32,160
-Come out, Meng Tinghui!
-Come out, Meng Tinghui!

54
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,960
-Come out here!
-Come out here!

55
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,200
Stop hiding like a coward!

56
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,200
Come out!

57
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,440
Stop hiding like a coward!

58
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,880
Meng Tinghui!

59
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:43,800
Meng Tinghui!

60
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,880
Don't move. Back away!

61
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,320
Meng Tinghui!

62
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,160
Calm down.

63
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,640
My father and grandmother
aren't even buried yet,

64
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,840
and you dare hide in there?

65
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,800
A birthday feast has become a funeral.

66
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,240
They died with grievances unresolved.

67
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,520
If I can't give them justice,

68
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,840
how can I lay them to rest?

69
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:13,000
How could you let Ling Yunfei escape?

70
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,960
Today, it was my Zhao family.

71
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,400
What about tomorrow?

72
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,000
Are we supposed to live

73
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:22,240
in fear and misery every day?

74
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:25,440
-Exactly!
-My son!

75
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:28,240
You said you'd marry
once you'd saved enough.

76
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,120
Now I, an old mother,

77
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,600
must bury my own son.

78
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:34,240
How am I supposed to go on?

79
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:39,760
You beasts living off the court!

80
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,960
You don't care
if commoners live or die!

81
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:45,080
-Stone them!
-Stone them!

82
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,840
-Stone them!
-Back away!

83
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:52,040
And you still have the nerve to stop us!

84
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,680
Yinqing.

85
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,280
I'm fine, my lord.

86
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,520
Everyone,

87
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,760
everyone,

88
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:11,280
I understand your pain and fear.

89
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,120
I, Meng Tinghui,

90
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:16,400
make this solemn pledge today:

91
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,480
within ten days,

92
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,840
I will eradicate the Infinity Pill,

93
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:20,960
capture Ling Yunfei,

94
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,800
and restore peace to the people.

95
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:25,480
Ten days? Can she do it?

96
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,400
Is she serious?

97
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,320
My lord, please reconsider.

98
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,680
Ten days is too short.

99
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,400
A military pledge is no joke.

100
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,480
You can't make one lightly.

101
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:34,200
My mind is made up.

102
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:35,280
I mean every word.

103
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:38,280
Everyone here may bear witness.

104
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,600
I give myself ten days.

105
00:08:40,680 --> 00:08:42,160
If I fail,

106
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,680
I will surrender my office
and become a commoner,

107
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,480
and accept punishment under the law

108
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,440
without complaint.

109
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,000
Your Majesty,

110
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,680
the Tiger's Roar Gang leader escaped,

111
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,600
and the Infinity Pill is still missing.

112
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,200
If he is allowed to return,

113
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:03,160
the capital will suffer greatly.

114
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,720
I impeach her today

115
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,480
because public anger is boiling over.

116
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:07,440
If it is not calmed,

117
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:08,640
chaos may erupt.

118
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,000
I implore Your Majesty

119
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:12,840
to strip her of office and punish her,

120
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,760
to reassure the people.

121
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,360
Your Majesty,

122
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,840
the Left Chancellor and I often disagree,

123
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,960
but this time

124
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,600
his words are sound.

125
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,320
Ling Yunfei has thrown
the capital into chaos

126
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:27,880
all because of Meng Tinghui.

127
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,640
Suspend her from office.

128
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,040
It will calm the people,

129
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,600
and force Ling Yunfei
to stay his hand for now.

130
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,520
Absurd!

131
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:40,200
The Tiger's Roar Gang caused this,

132
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,680
yet you want to punish

133
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,400
the head of the Office of Public Inquiry?

134
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,680
A mere bandit chief

135
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,800
and a single poison pill

136
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:48,120
have thrown my entire court into chaos.

137
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:50,440
If an enemy invades one day,

138
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:53,600
will you all rush
to submit surrender petitions?

139
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:55,960
Your Majesty.

140
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,960
Your Majesty.

141
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:58,960
I, Meng Tinghui,

142
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:00,840
willingly accept punishment.

143
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,240
The Infinity Pill case

144
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,280
is the Tiger's Roar Gang's crime,

145
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:08,760
but the Office of Public Inquiry
bears responsibility,

146
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,920
and I bear the greatest responsibility.

147
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:13,080
I have made a military pledge
to the people.

148
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,760
Within ten days,

149
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,040
if I fail to eradicate the Infinity Pill

150
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,480
and capture Ling Yunfei,

151
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,520
I will accept any punishment.

152
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,720
Meng Tinghui,

153
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,960
given your determination
to catch the culprit,

154
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,800
I grant you ten days.

155
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:35,960
Your Majesty, Meng Tinghui's pledge

156
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,640
merely fulfills her duty.

157
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,240
The present situation

158
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,960
was caused by her dereliction.

159
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,320
Under the Laws of Daning,

160
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:44,960
she should receive twenty strokes

161
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,080
as a warning to others.

162
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:47,320
Enough.

163
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:51,960
Meng Tinghui has made her pledge.

164
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,200
As court officials,

165
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:56,960
instead of working together
to suppress the bandits,

166
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:59,600
you attack a colleague
over street gossip.

167
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:02,200
I think you deserve
twenty strokes yourselves.

168
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:03,320
Your Majesty.

169
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,360
I saw the people's suffering
with my own eyes.

170
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,120
It pains me deeply.

171
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,600
I will bear the twenty strokes alone

172
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,200
to apologize to the people.

173
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,120
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

174
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,080
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

175
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:21,280
-We will share Lord Meng's punishment.
-We will share Lord Meng's punishment.

176
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,280
I head the Office of Public Inquiry.

177
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,720
I should bear it alone.

178
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:28,800
I am its deputy.
I share the responsibility.

179
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,800
I serve there too.
We stand together in hardship.

180
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:32,920
The case remains unsolved.
I cannot shirk my duty.

181
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:33,840
I share the responsibility too.

182
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,840
That must hurt terribly.

183
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,880
You've been frail since childhood.

184
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:47,080
Though they're only surface wounds,

185
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:49,080
you still need proper rest and care.

186
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:51,240
What I did this time

187
00:12:51,720 --> 00:12:53,120
wasn't a rash impulse.

188
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,360
I understand.

189
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:56,960
Back then,

190
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:59,680
I placed seventeenth in the first class
of the metropolitan examination.

191
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,880
When I first entered the Hanlin Academy,

192
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:05,040
I was just as full of youthful zeal.

193
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:08,160
Then I met your father,

194
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,680
became a wife and mother,

195
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:11,560
and had no regrets.

196
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:14,000
But today,

197
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,160
seeing you stand
with the Office of Public Inquiry,

198
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:19,320
I saw my younger self in you.

199
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,840
And compared with me,

200
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:23,560
you have an even greater sense of duty.

201
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:26,560
Mother.

202
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,240
I'm truly proud of you.

203
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,400
Mother.

204
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,840
Because I've walked this road,

205
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:36,520
I know how hard it is.

206
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,960
I only did what I should.

207
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:43,360
Precisely because the road ahead is hard,

208
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,240
Lord Meng is all the more admirable.

209
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:47,880
As a woman,

210
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,400
she leads the Office of Public Inquiry

211
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,280
and pledged before everyone.

212
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,840
She is a model for all women.

213
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:56,440
I need to recover quickly

214
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:57,560
and go help her.

215
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:00,440
My Li'er.

216
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,480
You've truly grown up.

217
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,120
I wonder

218
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,920
how Brother and A-Nian's injuries are.

219
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,400
Father.

220
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:19,320
Why can Zhili eat in her room

221
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,880
while I have to come to the hall?

222
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,240
I only walked a few steps,

223
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,200
and my back already hurts again.

224
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,360
If it's too much,

225
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,680
go back and rest.

226
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,160
How could I?

227
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:29,560
Pain is pain,

228
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:30,880
but I still have to eat.

229
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:33,560
Besides, Father cooked this himself.

230
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,800
It'd be a shame not to eat it.

231
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:37,960
Easy, Brother.

232
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:40,840
They hit your back.

233
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,000
Why? Does your rear hurt too?

234
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:45,440
I took a full twenty strokes!

235
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:47,280
It takes a hundred days
for bone and sinew to heal.

236
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,560
My back

237
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,160
probably doesn't have
a patch of good skin left.

238
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,040
A-Nian, sit down.

239
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:53,960
All right.

240
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,320
Look at you.

241
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:58,320
You've spent too long in pleasure houses,

242
00:14:58,400 --> 00:15:00,040
and your martial skills are getting rusty.

243
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,080
You need more practice.

244
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,280
Look at A-Nian.

245
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:05,320
He took the same twenty strokes.

246
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:07,000
When have you heard him complain?

247
00:15:07,560 --> 00:15:08,840
I'm used to rough treatment.

248
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,280
Unlike Brother,

249
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:13,080
who runs between Changle Street
and the Office every day.

250
00:15:13,160 --> 00:15:14,520
It's exhausting enough.

251
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:17,520
That's the responsibility
a Shen man should have.

252
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,760
Leading the Divine Guard
at such a young age,

253
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,120
charging into battle,

254
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,560
yet attentive and caring at home.

255
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:25,320
Well done. Come, drink.

256
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:26,440
Thank you, Father.

257
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:30,480
Father.

258
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:33,080
Your fine Shen son here

259
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:34,960
is tough as old leather.

260
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,840
I can't compete with him in toughness.

261
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:40,720
But I'm much stronger than Zhili.

262
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:42,360
She still can't get out of bed.

263
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,960
My son has really accomplished something.

264
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,040
As her elder brother,

265
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,440
you're actually comparing yourself
to your sister?

266
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:48,680
Aren't you ashamed?

267
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:54,440
I wonder how Zhili's injuries are.

268
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,280
Your mother is caring for her.

269
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,200
She'll be fine.

270
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,120
Eat.

271
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,320
Grand Tutor.

272
00:16:01,200 --> 00:16:03,040
The tonics you asked for are ready.

273
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:04,640
Father.

274
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,240
Let me take them to Zhili.

275
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:07,960
All right.

276
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:10,000
Thank you, Father.

277
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,600
A-Nian really is

278
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:18,040
made of sturdy stuff.

279
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,520
Father, look.

280
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,800
My standing in this family

281
00:16:22,880 --> 00:16:24,040
is lower than dust.

282
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,680
With all this good food and drink,

283
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:27,080
you still can't keep your mouth shut?

284
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:28,040
Just eat.

285
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,200
Thank you, Father.

286
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:51,920
Brat.

287
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:54,960
Here.

288
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:18,360
How did you get beaten this badly?

289
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:21,480
Fuzhi, please don't cry.

290
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:23,520
I've been hurt

291
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,720
much worse than this before.

292
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,200
I'll be fine in a couple of days.

293
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:33,080
No matter how badly you were hurt before,

294
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:34,600
you always smiled and said you were fine.

295
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:38,480
Those learned male officials at court

296
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:41,000
don't help you investigate
the Tiger's Roar Gang,

297
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:42,080
and they treat you like this?

298
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,640
I'm going to ask His Majesty myself.

299
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,960
You only want what's best for Daning.

300
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:47,440
Why couldn't he protect you?

301
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,720
Miss Yan was looking for me?

302
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:01,200
Your Majesty.

303
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,040
Mengmeng is my only family.

304
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:04,240
All this way,

305
00:18:04,320 --> 00:18:06,160
she's been framed and bullied,

306
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:07,880
humiliated and threatened,

307
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,960
and nearly killed time and again.

308
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:12,520
The people who targeted her
were all vicious criminals.

309
00:18:12,600 --> 00:18:13,520
But this time,

310
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,440
Your Majesty personally
ordered her punished.

311
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:17,960
-Fuzhi.
-To give the officials an answer,

312
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:20,840
so you used my Mengmeng as your weapon.

313
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,240
But she's precious to me too.

314
00:18:23,320 --> 00:18:24,440
If after ten days

315
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:25,960
she still hasn't solved it,

316
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:28,280
I only ask Your Majesty to spare her life.

317
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,280
Strip her of rank
and make her a commoner.

318
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:31,040
I'll take her back to Shazhou.

319
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:32,200
From then on,

320
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:34,440
I won't let anyone hurt her again.

321
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:35,360
I've said what I came to say.

322
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,880
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

323
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,840
Miss Yan.

324
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:41,640
I promise you.

325
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:45,040
What you fear will not happen.

326
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:49,320
Your Majesty's word is absolute.

327
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:51,840
I'll remember it for Mengmeng.

328
00:18:56,560 --> 00:18:58,320
I won't disturb
Your Majesty and Mengmeng.

329
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:11,960
Your Majesty.

330
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,080
Fuzhi

331
00:19:16,600 --> 00:19:18,200
is worried for my safety.

332
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,480
Please don't blame her.

333
00:19:20,560 --> 00:19:21,520
She's right.

334
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,320
This is my fault.

335
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,960
I failed to protect you.

336
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:31,640
I brought wound medicine
sent as tribute from Beijian.

337
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,520
It relieves pain and prevents scarring.

338
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:36,400
I'll apply it for you.

339
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:43,640
I...

340
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:47,120
dare not trouble Your Majesty.

341
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,800
You won't even let me
do this small thing for you?

342
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:57,240
It may sting at first.

343
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,160
There may be a burning sensation.

344
00:20:01,040 --> 00:20:02,120
I'll be careful.

345
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:47,200
This mark on your back

346
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,240
is rather unusual.

347
00:20:49,320 --> 00:20:50,440
A mark?

348
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:54,160
Which one do you mean, Your Majesty?

349
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:57,000
I was beaten often as a child

350
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:59,360
and have many scars.

351
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:01,080
I don't remember them all.

352
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:03,760
Your Majesty.

353
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:05,920
The ten-day deadline is close.

354
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:08,040
Perhaps only by finding the valley

355
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,640
can we stop the Infinity Pill spreading.

356
00:21:11,560 --> 00:21:13,360
Tomorrow, I want to search
the outskirts with Yinqing.

357
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:14,320
Don't concern yourself with anything.

358
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:17,360
I've ordered Huang Bo to find the valley.

359
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,960
Your priority now

360
00:21:20,040 --> 00:21:21,800
is to rest and recover your strength.

361
00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:23,400
Otherwise,

362
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,320
I may truly take away
that official robe of yours.

363
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,000
I obey.

364
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:42,200
The Mystic Bird guards Zhongwan.

365
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:44,920
Royal descendants bear a secret mark
on the shoulder from childhood,

366
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:46,240
which becomes clearer with age.

367
00:21:46,320 --> 00:21:47,640
Your Majesty saw it clearly.

368
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,080
The mark on Lord Meng's shoulder

369
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:50,640
is indeed the Mystic Bird totem.

370
00:21:50,720 --> 00:21:52,800
Though the mark overlaps with scars,

371
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:53,800
it is unmistakable.

372
00:21:54,960 --> 00:21:56,320
I vaguely remember

373
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:58,880
the Zhongwan royals Father executed

374
00:21:58,960 --> 00:22:00,320
also bore such a mark.

375
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:02,360
But I was young then.

376
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:04,200
As for what happened back then,

377
00:22:04,280 --> 00:22:06,320
only the Grand Tutor knows clearly.

378
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,600
More than ten years ago,

379
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:10,280
the Zhongwan royal house
coveted Daning's riches

380
00:22:10,360 --> 00:22:11,480
and provoked us repeatedly.

381
00:22:12,040 --> 00:22:13,040
The late Emperor had enough

382
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:14,240
and led the campaign himself.

383
00:22:14,800 --> 00:22:17,040
The Zhongwan royals resisted to the end,

384
00:22:17,120 --> 00:22:19,480
but were crushed by his iron hand.

385
00:22:19,560 --> 00:22:21,560
The four-year-old Zhongwan princess

386
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:23,240
also died inside the palace.

387
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:25,480
Only a band of death-sworn guards

388
00:22:25,560 --> 00:22:28,320
broke through with a general's son.

389
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:31,360
Judging by their ages,

390
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:33,440
Lord Meng and the Zhongwan princess
would be the same age.

391
00:22:33,520 --> 00:22:35,480
But wasn't the Zhongwan princess dead?

392
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:37,120
It now appears

393
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:39,320
the dead princess may have been a decoy.

394
00:22:40,320 --> 00:22:42,000
Perhaps Zhongwan remnants

395
00:22:42,080 --> 00:22:43,320
wanted to restore their nation

396
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:45,480
and preserve a line of royal blood.

397
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:48,160
Huiyin House and the Blood Moon Society

398
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,600
were already plotting a restoration.

399
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:51,720
Situ Xue is also very close to Lord Meng.

400
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:53,240
Perhaps

401
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:56,280
Lord Meng is one of them,
sent to infiltrate the court.

402
00:22:58,280 --> 00:23:00,240
Daning's ancestral law still states

403
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:01,600
that Zhongwan survivors
must live as slaves or servants

404
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:02,920
and may never serve as court officials.

405
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:04,480
The late Emperor enacted this to prevent

406
00:23:04,560 --> 00:23:07,400
traitors from disrupting the court
and harming the people.

407
00:23:08,080 --> 00:23:10,920
Now a Zhongwan restoration
is stirring in secret.

408
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:12,760
Its royal bloodline

409
00:23:12,840 --> 00:23:15,120
must be eradicated completely.

410
00:23:15,760 --> 00:23:18,160
Grand Tutor, are you asking me
to execute Lord Meng?

411
00:23:29,280 --> 00:23:32,280
I have long since retired.

412
00:23:32,360 --> 00:23:34,480
I should not interfere in court affairs.

413
00:23:34,560 --> 00:23:35,960
But Your Majesty and Meng Tinghui

414
00:23:36,040 --> 00:23:36,880
have grown exceedingly close.

415
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:38,400
There is already criticism outside.

416
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:39,920
I am deeply concerned.

417
00:23:40,720 --> 00:23:42,640
Please think carefully, Your Majesty.

418
00:23:42,720 --> 00:23:45,000
Be more cautious with Meng Tinghui,

419
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:46,880
and remain vigilant

420
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:49,360
against the Blood Moon Society.

421
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:50,480
Only then

422
00:23:50,560 --> 00:23:51,920
can we guard against the unforeseen

423
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,640
and keep the court stable.

424
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:57,360
Father, don't worry.

425
00:23:57,440 --> 00:23:59,080
His Majesty already told me
to watch Huiyin House

426
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:00,520
and secretly investigate
the Blood Moon Society.

427
00:24:01,080 --> 00:24:03,520
His Majesty would never put
private feelings before public duty.

428
00:24:04,280 --> 00:24:06,840
Still, Lord Meng's identity

429
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:08,640
truly warrants renewed scrutiny.

430
00:24:12,800 --> 00:24:14,680
This concerns an old feud
between two states.

431
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,520
I will not take it lightly

432
00:24:16,600 --> 00:24:17,600
or act on emotion.

433
00:24:18,320 --> 00:24:19,520
Meng Tinghui and the Office
of Public Inquiry,

434
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:21,320
I will consider everything carefully.

435
00:24:22,520 --> 00:24:23,680
Your Majesty is wise.

436
00:24:24,840 --> 00:24:26,360
Until there is a conclusion,

437
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:28,120
we will keep this strictly secret.

438
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:30,240
Zhishu, especially you.

439
00:24:32,080 --> 00:24:33,720
Father, I have enough self-control

440
00:24:33,800 --> 00:24:34,760
to know better.

441
00:25:08,320 --> 00:25:09,800
The Tiger's Roar Gang's storerooms,

442
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:10,720
hidden cellars,

443
00:25:11,320 --> 00:25:12,400
even the caves behind the mountain

444
00:25:12,480 --> 00:25:13,400
have all been searched.

445
00:25:14,560 --> 00:25:16,200
Not a single Infinity Pill was found.

446
00:25:16,280 --> 00:25:18,560
And for dozens of miles
around their stronghold,

447
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:19,960
there is nothing but sand and stone.

448
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:21,360
It cannot be where the poison is made.

449
00:25:21,440 --> 00:25:22,320
Logically,

450
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:23,680
Ling Yunfei is badly wounded.

451
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,640
If he doesn't want to bleed to death,

452
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:26,960
his hiding place

453
00:25:27,040 --> 00:25:28,280
shouldn't be far from the capital.

454
00:25:29,600 --> 00:25:31,960
A-Nian, you searched
the valleys outside the capital.

455
00:25:32,440 --> 00:25:34,440
Did you truly find no clues at all?

456
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:36,720
We searched seventeen valleys.

457
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:39,320
Each was compared with the painting.

458
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,840
Huang Bo has led the Divine Guard

459
00:25:40,920 --> 00:25:42,160
deep into the miasma forest.

460
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,840
No word has come back yet.

461
00:25:44,520 --> 00:25:47,120
Though the gang's stronghold is destroyed,

462
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:48,720
as long as Ling Yunfei lives,

463
00:25:48,800 --> 00:25:50,480
given that madman's nature,

464
00:25:50,560 --> 00:25:52,800
he will plot an even crueler revenge.

465
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:56,960
My lord.

466
00:25:57,040 --> 00:25:57,880
Your wounds...

467
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:00,200
I'm fine.

468
00:26:00,280 --> 00:26:02,240
Zhili, draft a memorial now.

469
00:26:02,320 --> 00:26:03,880
Ask His Majesty for reinforcements.

470
00:26:03,960 --> 00:26:06,040
We must find where the poison is made
as soon as possible.

471
00:26:06,600 --> 00:26:07,520
Otherwise,

472
00:26:08,600 --> 00:26:09,680
the consequences are unthinkable.

473
00:27:45,200 --> 00:27:46,800
Lock the chains tighter.

474
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:47,720
Yes.

475
00:27:52,600 --> 00:27:53,440
Chief.

476
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:55,160
As you ordered,

477
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,440
the dose of Fuqing Grass

478
00:27:56,520 --> 00:27:57,400
has been tripled.

479
00:27:59,760 --> 00:28:02,320
What an intoxicating fragrance.

480
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:07,080
But it is still not enough.

481
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:08,280
Increase the dose.

482
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:09,320
Within ten days,

483
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:11,560
harvest every stalk of Fuqing Grass
in Wangxian Valley.

484
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:12,560
This time,

485
00:28:13,440 --> 00:28:14,680
either Meng Tinghui dies,

486
00:28:14,760 --> 00:28:16,480
or I, Ling Yunfei, do.

487
00:28:16,560 --> 00:28:18,600
Then you should prepare your funeral.

488
00:28:19,760 --> 00:28:22,080
Mr. Shangguan honors us with a visit.

489
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,680
It seems you've finally lost patience.

490
00:28:24,760 --> 00:28:26,360
To get revenge on Meng Tinghui,

491
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:29,480
you spread the Infinity Pill
at Bofeng Tavern.

492
00:28:29,560 --> 00:28:31,360
Now the whole city is under lockdown.

493
00:28:31,440 --> 00:28:33,800
Do you intend to ruin
our business with your own hands?

494
00:28:34,280 --> 00:28:36,200
You hide in the shadows all day

495
00:28:36,280 --> 00:28:37,680
to make petty profits.

496
00:28:38,960 --> 00:28:40,280
Is that

497
00:28:40,360 --> 00:28:41,920
all you cowards aspire to?

498
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,120
Listen carefully.

499
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:45,880
If you dare trouble Meng Tinghui again,

500
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:47,960
I don't mind sending you
to your grave first.

501
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:50,840
What exactly is your relationship
with Meng Tinghui?

502
00:28:51,760 --> 00:28:53,040
Every other sentence is about her,

503
00:28:53,800 --> 00:28:55,240
and you protect her at every turn.

504
00:28:55,320 --> 00:28:56,800
Our business

505
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:58,320
together

506
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,240
ends here.

507
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:12,920
You think I'll just sit and wait to die?

508
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:16,320
Look. This is the Infinity Pill's
true power.

509
00:29:16,960 --> 00:29:18,520
I'll use an army of poisoned men

510
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:20,280
to bathe the capital in blood.

511
00:29:20,360 --> 00:29:21,840
Meng Tinghui, prepare to die.

512
00:29:31,560 --> 00:29:34,200
(Bofeng Tavern Temporary Closure Notice)

513
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:41,680
I wanted to save enough silver

514
00:29:41,760 --> 00:29:43,000
to buy a large house.

515
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:44,320
The two of us

516
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:45,640
could live comfortably there.

517
00:29:47,320 --> 00:29:48,400
Now I've lost everything.

518
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:53,880
I snatched my life back from death

519
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:55,200
thanks to you, Mengmeng.

520
00:29:57,320 --> 00:29:58,880
It was thanks to Lord Shen.

521
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,520
To get medicine for you,

522
00:30:00,600 --> 00:30:02,560
he even pawned the jade pendant
gifted by the late Emperor.

523
00:30:03,920 --> 00:30:07,120
His Majesty knew he was saving a life
and did not punish him.

524
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:09,320
But Zhili told me

525
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:12,960
Grand Tutor Shen made him kneel
in the ancestral hall for three days.

526
00:30:16,400 --> 00:30:17,600
He truly cares about you.

527
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:23,320
After narrowly escaping death,

528
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:25,400
I realized wealth is easy to find,

529
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:26,520
but a true friend is rare.

530
00:30:26,600 --> 00:30:28,200
Since you all gave everything for me,

531
00:30:29,120 --> 00:30:30,160
I should live well.

532
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,800
Bofeng Tavern will close for two months.

533
00:30:34,880 --> 00:30:36,600
I'll create more new dishes

534
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:38,120
so when we reopen,

535
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:40,240
the capital's diners will be amazed.

536
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:43,760
But you're not fully recovered.

537
00:30:43,840 --> 00:30:45,000
Bofeng Tavern still isn't safe.

538
00:30:45,080 --> 00:30:46,880
Stay at the Office for now.

539
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:47,920
I'll be there to look after you.

540
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:48,920
You...

541
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:51,960
You've been buried in chasing Ling Yunfei.
How could you possibly look after me?

542
00:30:52,040 --> 00:30:53,920
The military pledge deadline is near,

543
00:30:54,880 --> 00:30:56,280
but every lead on Ling Yunfei is gone.

544
00:30:56,360 --> 00:30:58,400
The Light Riders have searched for days,

545
00:30:58,480 --> 00:30:59,720
yet no one has reported back.

546
00:31:00,520 --> 00:31:02,760
Even His Majesty hasn't come
to the Office for days.

547
00:31:03,480 --> 00:31:05,040
Something feels strange.

548
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:07,480
All right.

549
00:31:07,560 --> 00:31:09,240
Enough thinking. Let's go out.

550
00:31:18,040 --> 00:31:19,160
-Yinqing.
-Lord Meng.

551
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:21,800
-Proprietor Yan.
-You went to Huiyin House.

552
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:23,600
Mistress Situ often travels
to the frontier.

553
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:26,080
She has rare medicines, candles,
and incense not found in the capital.

554
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:29,040
Proprietor Yan has only just recovered
and needs to rebuild her strength.

555
00:31:29,120 --> 00:31:30,280
Thank you for taking the trouble.

556
00:31:31,520 --> 00:31:34,160
Any progress from Commandant Di's
search of the valleys?

557
00:31:34,240 --> 00:31:37,280
Why has not a single message
reached the Office from the Light Riders?

558
00:31:37,360 --> 00:31:39,560
His Majesty personally deployed
the Divine Guard.

559
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:40,680
All intelligence

560
00:31:41,280 --> 00:31:42,720
is reported directly to the throne.

561
00:31:44,520 --> 00:31:45,760
But I did hear some good news.

562
00:31:45,840 --> 00:31:46,840
I happened to hear

563
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:48,520
the Light Riders found a valley

564
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:50,680
somewhat like the one in the painting.

565
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:53,440
But the memorial you submitted

566
00:31:53,520 --> 00:31:54,960
requesting reinforcements

567
00:31:55,520 --> 00:31:56,640
still has not been approved.

568
00:31:58,760 --> 00:32:01,320
The Divine Guard should assist
the Office in its investigations.

569
00:32:01,840 --> 00:32:03,480
Yet now they are bypassing me.

570
00:32:04,040 --> 00:32:05,080
Lend me this candle.

571
00:32:06,320 --> 00:32:08,160
Your Majesty, the Light Rider units report

572
00:32:08,240 --> 00:32:09,680
that Huang Bo disappeared

573
00:32:09,760 --> 00:32:11,840
at the last valley still unsearched,

574
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:12,840
Wangxian Valley.

575
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,360
The terrain there is treacherous,

576
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:15,640
and mist shrouds it year-round,

577
00:32:15,720 --> 00:32:16,560
obscuring all visibility.

578
00:32:16,640 --> 00:32:17,960
At the valley entrance, the Light Riders

579
00:32:18,040 --> 00:32:19,320
found Huang Bo's dagger.

580
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,760
Huang Bo never loses
anything he carries.

581
00:32:22,320 --> 00:32:23,640
Could something have happened to him?

582
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:25,160
Take the Light Riders
and search the mountain at once.

583
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:26,880
Should we inform Lord Meng?

584
00:32:27,800 --> 00:32:28,880
As for this valley,

585
00:32:28,960 --> 00:32:30,920
we have no proof yet
that Fuqing Grass grows there.

586
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:32,160
Do not alarm her for now.

587
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:34,880
-Investigate it thoroughly first.
-I understand.

588
00:32:34,960 --> 00:32:37,360
Your Majesty, this old servant has sinned!

589
00:32:37,920 --> 00:32:38,840
Not again.

590
00:32:39,560 --> 00:32:41,240
With Huang Bo away these past few days,

591
00:32:41,320 --> 00:32:43,480
he has nagged my ears raw.

592
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,120
Go help me

593
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:46,400
stop Chief Steward You before you leave.

594
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:48,320
Yes.

595
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:56,720
Your Majesty personally risked yourself
at the Tiger's Roar Gang.

596
00:32:56,800 --> 00:32:59,560
This old servant fears for your safety.

597
00:32:59,640 --> 00:33:01,000
Every day my heart

598
00:33:01,080 --> 00:33:03,360
is in my throat.

599
00:33:03,440 --> 00:33:05,640
I have failed the late Emperor.

600
00:33:06,320 --> 00:33:07,320
Commandant Di,

601
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:08,640
lend me your sword.

602
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:10,840
I'll go meet the late Emperor first!

603
00:33:22,040 --> 00:33:25,320
Commandant Di, I was beside myself.

604
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:28,520
His Majesty has stayed up late
reviewing memorials.

605
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:31,960
It seems he caught a chill.

606
00:33:32,040 --> 00:33:34,320
The physician prescribed this remedy.

607
00:33:34,880 --> 00:33:36,240
Your Majesty,

608
00:33:36,320 --> 00:33:38,280
you must take care of yourself.

609
00:33:39,120 --> 00:33:40,360
-Your Maj...
-Go back.

610
00:33:42,960 --> 00:33:44,000
Your Majesty.

611
00:33:44,080 --> 00:33:46,360
You must take good care of yourself.

612
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,560
Your Majesty.

613
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:48,640
Your Majesty.

614
00:34:00,200 --> 00:34:01,720
Can you stop bothering me?

615
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:07,960
So Your Majesty finds me bothersome.

616
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:09,840
Is that why you haven't visited
the Office lately?

617
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:11,640
I thought it was Chief Steward You.

618
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:13,920
This is from Huiyin House.

619
00:34:14,520 --> 00:34:16,160
Miss Situ specially blended it.

620
00:34:16,240 --> 00:34:18,040
She said it calms the mind
and restores the spirit.

621
00:34:18,120 --> 00:34:20,960
You've exhausted yourself lately
over the Infinity Pill.

622
00:34:21,720 --> 00:34:22,560
You should try it.

623
00:34:22,640 --> 00:34:24,360
You came here specifically today

624
00:34:25,040 --> 00:34:26,200
not just to bring this gift, did you?

625
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:28,040
The memorial I submitted

626
00:34:28,120 --> 00:34:30,200
requesting more staff for the Office

627
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:31,920
has yet to receive imperial approval.

628
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:38,360
This drawing...

629
00:34:39,600 --> 00:34:40,440
do you recognize it?

630
00:34:48,800 --> 00:34:49,760
I do not.

631
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:52,200
This is the Heaven-ordained Mystic Bird
revered in Zhongwan.

632
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:54,480
It is said to foretell good and ill

633
00:34:54,560 --> 00:34:56,000
and protect the nation's destiny.

634
00:34:56,080 --> 00:34:58,400
Later, Zhongwan submitted to Daning.

635
00:34:58,480 --> 00:35:01,200
Do you think Daning's policy
toward Zhongwan survivors

636
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,280
should be reformed?

637
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:03,520
Your Majesty.

638
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:07,040
I've only read about Zhongwan's past
in historical texts.

639
00:35:08,200 --> 00:35:09,400
I don't know what truly happened.

640
00:35:13,640 --> 00:35:15,080
Miss Yan only just escaped danger.

641
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,160
I don't want you risking yourself again.

642
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:20,200
I have decided on another plan.

643
00:35:20,280 --> 00:35:22,520
-The Office should leave this case.
-Your Majesty.

644
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:24,600
I know the difference
between public and private.

645
00:35:24,680 --> 00:35:25,920
What happened to Fuzhi

646
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:27,280
torments me day and night.

647
00:35:27,360 --> 00:35:29,160
Even if I do harbor selfish motives,

648
00:35:29,240 --> 00:35:30,560
so what?

649
00:35:30,640 --> 00:35:31,800
The Ling Yunfei case

650
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:34,000
has been pursued by the Office all along,

651
00:35:34,080 --> 00:35:35,760
and I am the best person for it.

652
00:35:35,840 --> 00:35:37,200
Please withdraw your order.

653
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:39,360
Ling Yunfei will not stop pursuing you.

654
00:35:39,440 --> 00:35:40,640
I am worried for your safety.

655
00:35:40,720 --> 00:35:42,480
Take some time to rest.

656
00:35:43,040 --> 00:35:44,560
Consider that my own selfishness.

657
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:47,400
I feel Your Majesty

658
00:35:47,480 --> 00:35:49,120
has been acting strangely lately.

659
00:35:49,200 --> 00:35:50,800
Are you hiding something from me?

660
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:51,920
Do not overthink it.

661
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:53,880
Follow my decree.

662
00:35:59,800 --> 00:36:02,120
Your Majesty, of all the court officials,

663
00:36:02,200 --> 00:36:03,920
who knows Ling Yunfei
better than the Office?

664
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,560
If Your Majesty is worried about me,

665
00:36:06,160 --> 00:36:07,640
you may send people with me.

666
00:36:08,360 --> 00:36:10,680
But if the Office is forced off this case,

667
00:36:10,760 --> 00:36:12,080
then I will go myself.

668
00:36:13,480 --> 00:36:14,600
If Your Majesty does not trust me,

669
00:36:15,600 --> 00:36:17,320
I need not wait for your decree.

670
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:21,040
I already know where Wangxian Valley is.

671
00:36:21,120 --> 00:36:23,000
From the day we met,

672
00:36:24,120 --> 00:36:25,920
I knew this was your nature.

673
00:36:32,520 --> 00:36:33,720
I trust you.

674
00:36:34,720 --> 00:36:36,120
But that means allowing you
to place yourself in danger.

675
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:39,480
I want this realm kept safe,

676
00:36:39,560 --> 00:36:40,520
but I also want you, Meng Tinghui,

677
00:36:40,600 --> 00:36:42,480
to return safe and whole.

678
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:44,800
Wangxian Valley's terrain is complex.

679
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:47,120
I will go with you.

680
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:26,760
You're awake.

681
00:37:28,080 --> 00:37:29,600
Thank goodness.

682
00:37:29,680 --> 00:37:31,520
I was afraid you'd keep sleeping forever.

683
00:37:33,800 --> 00:37:35,040
Don't move.

684
00:37:40,320 --> 00:37:42,040
I'm only listening to your heartbeat,

685
00:37:42,120 --> 00:37:43,800
to see how well you're recovering.

686
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:52,680
After taking my medicine,

687
00:37:52,760 --> 00:37:54,200
the snake venom is gone.

688
00:37:55,240 --> 00:37:56,360
However,

689
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:59,320
your injured leg needs
a few more days of rest.

690
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:00,840
Be good these next few days.

691
00:38:00,920 --> 00:38:02,480
Don't rush out and run around.

692
00:38:32,120 --> 00:38:33,600
Thank you for saving my life, miss.

693
00:38:33,680 --> 00:38:34,920
You're welcome.

694
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:37,840
I'm A-Luo, a resident of Wangxian Valley.

695
00:38:38,560 --> 00:38:39,400
You...

696
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:41,280
what is your name?

697
00:38:42,560 --> 00:38:44,040
My name is Huang Bo.

698
00:38:44,600 --> 00:38:45,560
Huang Bo.

699
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:58,840
Miss A-Luo.

700
00:38:59,800 --> 00:39:00,640
Let me help you.

701
00:39:00,720 --> 00:39:01,760
Your leg hasn't healed yet.

702
00:39:01,840 --> 00:39:02,800
Don't move around.

703
00:39:06,200 --> 00:39:07,120
Old Huang!

704
00:39:07,400 --> 00:39:08,240
Old Huang!

705
00:39:09,920 --> 00:39:10,760
Young Master.

706
00:39:10,840 --> 00:39:11,680
Careful.

707
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:13,840
How did you all get here?

708
00:39:19,640 --> 00:39:20,600
Miss A-Luo.

709
00:39:20,680 --> 00:39:21,920
There are so many of us,

710
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:23,160
and we came to stay at your home
without warning.

711
00:39:23,240 --> 00:39:24,200
I'm sorry to impose.

712
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:25,520
Not at all.

713
00:39:25,600 --> 00:39:27,640
Few outsiders ever come here.

714
00:39:27,720 --> 00:39:29,480
It's rare for my home
to be this lively.

715
00:39:29,560 --> 00:39:30,920
Besides,

716
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:32,720
you're all so handsome,

717
00:39:33,280 --> 00:39:34,920
and dressed much better than we are.

718
00:39:43,600 --> 00:39:44,800
Miss A-Luo.

719
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:46,800
The scenery shown in this painting,

720
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:48,480
is it somewhere inside the valley?

721
00:39:49,040 --> 00:39:51,240
Our peaks are beautiful,

722
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:52,360
wrapped in clouds and mist.

723
00:39:52,440 --> 00:39:55,080
From the valley floor,
it looks like an immortal realm.

724
00:39:55,640 --> 00:39:58,440
The scenery in this painting

725
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:02,160
does indeed resemble our valley.

726
00:40:02,240 --> 00:40:03,200
Then, Miss A-Luo,

727
00:40:03,720 --> 00:40:05,360
-do you know of a kind of...
-Miss A-Luo.

728
00:40:06,280 --> 00:40:07,320
I see your courtyard

729
00:40:07,400 --> 00:40:09,960
is full of flowers.
What are they used for?

730
00:40:10,040 --> 00:40:12,320
Tomorrow is our valley's Flower Festival.

731
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:14,600
I'm preparing flower cakes
for the celebration.

732
00:40:15,160 --> 00:40:16,240
Make yourselves comfortable.

733
00:40:16,320 --> 00:40:17,400
Have a good chat.

734
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:18,360
If you need anything,

735
00:40:18,440 --> 00:40:19,400
just call me.

736
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:28,480
Lord Meng.

737
00:40:28,560 --> 00:40:30,640
I was about to ask
where the Fuqing Grass is.

738
00:40:30,720 --> 00:40:32,320
Why did you stop me?
